<section id="claim">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Merch &amp; Physical NFT Claim Pipeline</div>
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Claim Your Piece of the Vault</h2>
      <p>Every piece of official Bank of Spanky physical merchandise comes embedded with an exclusive digital claim. Order any qualifying shirt, hat, pin, or limited release, scan the integrated verification QR code on arrival, and receive a free companion NFT directly into your Solana wallet.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pipeline">
