      </div>
      <div class="access-card">
        <h3>Token-Gated Discord &amp; Telegram Hubs</h3>
        <p>Automated wallet-verification bot clearance to unlock VIP channels, community voting, and private voice hangouts.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="blueprint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-eyebrow">Project Utility &amp; Capital Allocation</div>
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>The Blueprint</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="alloc-rows">
      <div class="alloc-row">
        <h3>Liquidity &amp; Token Reserve</h3>
        <p>Mint revenue fuels future memecoin liquidity pool pairing and secondary supply floor stabilization.</p>
      </div>
