    <h2>A Movement, Not Just a Brand</h2>
    <p>A lifestyle for every real degen who dares to dream bigger, flex harder, and never play small.</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="#" style="padding:0 0 3px;">Read the Story</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="newsletter">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Join the OG Family</h2>
    <p>Pink and rabbit-themed updates, drops, and news — straight to your inbox.</p>
    <form class="newsletter-form">
      <input type="email" placeholder="Email address">
      <button type="submit">Sign Up</button>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="brand" style="display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:12px;">
      <img src="https://mediumturquoise-grasshopper-556994.hostingersite.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/cropped-LOGO.png" alt="OGSPANKY logo" style="height:30px;">
      Bank of Spanky
